{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shiyi-e-2b9d127a833a0306a2c4","title":"是仪不治产业，拯赡贫困","accounts":[{"id":"shiyi-a-2b9d127a833a0306a2c4","label":"正文","text":"是仪不治产业，拯赡贫困","evidence":["shiyi-q-82494de5532c9d66f69d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shiyi-p-ef2e1c7010751a","role":"清俭赈赡者","evidence":["shiyi-q-82494de5532c9d66f69d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["shiyi-q-82494de5532c9d66f69d"]},"ordering_evidence":"shiyi-q-82494de5532c9d66f69d","order":10802}],"persons":[{"id":"shiyi-p-ef2e1c7010751a","name":"是仪","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shiyi-q-82494de5532c9d66f69d","section":"chapter-062","block":"b-18db2fb2ebbe8aeeff67","layer":"original","quote":"事上勤，与人恭。不治产业，不受施惠；为屋舍，才足自容。邻家有起大宅者，权出望见，问：“起大室者谁？”左右对曰：“似是仪家也。”权曰：“仪俭，必非也！”问果他家。其见知信如此。服不精细，食不重膳〖5〗；拯赡贫困，家无储蓄。权闻之，幸仪舍，求视蔬饭，亲尝之；对之叹息，即增俸赐，益田宅。仪累辞让，以恩为戚〖6〗。","section_title":"是仪胡综传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0131.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
